<title>GERMANY: VEW Energie nine-month pre-tax profit up 20.5 pct.</title>
<headline>VEW Energie nine-month pre-tax profit up 20.5 pct.</headline>
<dateline>DORTMUND, Germany 1996-11-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nine months to end September 1996 (in millions of marks unless stated)</p>
<p>    Group pre-tax profit		     306     up 20.5 pct</p>
<p>    Group sales				  4,240   down 0.4 pct</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of the German gas and electricity group is VEW Energie, a unit of the German utility VEW AG.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom +49 69 756525</p>
</text>
